		"summary": "Unlike Wordle, which checks letter positions, Contexto.me uses an artificial intelligence natural language model (GloVe word embeddings) to rank every word in the dictionary from #1 (the secret word) to #50,000+ based on how frequently words appear in similar real-world contexts. Starting with broad category anchors—Person, Object, Place, Food, Action—lets you hit the green zone (under #300) in under 10 guesses.",
