				"Green (#1–#300) means hot, Orange (#301–#1,500) means warm, and Pink (#1,500+) means cold.",
				"Use the 5-Anchor opener: PERSON, OBJECT, PLACE, NATURE, and WORK to narrow the domain in 5 moves.",
				"If you get stuck inside the top 15, pivot from synonyms to the environment or tool associated with your closest guesses."
