					"body": "Smart deal hunters know that retailers hold back specific online-only inventory for Monday, November 30. The best Cyber Monday categories include gaming laptops, M4 MacBooks, and PC monitors from Dell, HP, Lenovo, and Amazon; streaming service annual promos ($0.99–$1.99/month deals on Hulu, Peacock, and Paramount+); sitewide apparel promo codes (25%–40% off entire carts at Nike, Adidas, and Nordstrom); and creative software."
