					"body": "By federal law under the Protecting Americans from Tax Hikes (PATH) Act, the IRS must hold the entire refund for any return claiming the Earned Income Tax Credit (EITC) or Additional Child Tax Credit (ACTC) until mid-February to prevent identity theft fraud. Expect 'Where’s My Refund?' updates around February 18–21 and bank deposits starting the final week of February."
